{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"环路空间"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 "},{"Local":{"url":"无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 有终对象 $*$. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点对象"}},{"Plain":" $x\\colon *\\to X$, 定义其<strong>环路空间</strong> $\\Omega X = \\Omega (X,x)$ 是如下拉回,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\Omega (X,x) &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\to &amp; X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}